# System Reference Library — code→doc map (drives the pre-push freshness gate, R107)
#
# Format (one subsystem per line):
#   docs/systems/<doc>.md|<comma-separated code path prefixes>
#
# Rule enforced by scripts/check-system-docs-freshness.sh on every push:
#   If a push changes any file under one of a subsystem's code prefixes but does
#   NOT also update that subsystem's doc, the push is blocked. Override (rare,
#   deliberate): ALLOW_SYSTEM_DOC_SKIP=1 git push ...
#
# Add a line here when you create a new docs/systems/<x>.md so it self-enforces.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

